# Design reference books kept in the working copy. Named individually rather
# than *.pdf so a PDF the app genuinely needs is not silently ignored. The
# largest is 140 MB — well past GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so committing one
# by accident fails the push only after it is already in history.
